Third-party data

The map data embedded in index.html (municipal boundary, roads, streets,
villages, archaeological sites, wineries and peaks) comes from OpenStreetMap
and is © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License
(ODbL) 1.0: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright. It is not covered by the
MIT License above.

The base map tiles are loaded at runtime from Esri and OpenStreetMap and are
subject to their own terms.
